From 49f18368736914235fa133bd267ff92e93b6d35c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 08:23:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] zram: default mfz_enable to 1 like Xiaomi's driver
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Xiaomi's zram enables memory freeze by default: zram_add() in the 6.6
source sets mfz_enable = 1 and mfz_disk_quota = 0, and the official
yudi zram.ko does the same (zram_add stores 1 to the field that
mfz_enable_show reads). PerfInit relies on that: it only writes 0 to
mfz_enable when persist.sys.mfz.enable is false, and otherwise just
writes mfz_disk_quota (persist.sys.mfz.disk_quota, default 2048 MB =
524288 pages). 0028 left mfz_enable at 0, so on this ROM the reserved
backing space for frozen apps was never in effect (r6 showed
mfz_enable=0 with persist.sys.mfz.enable=true).

Origin: MiCode/Xiaomi_Kernel_OpenSource bixi-v-oss 56295df675b9（zram_add 中 mfz_enable = 1）；官方 yudi zram.ko 反汇编核对；PerfInit 反汇编（只在 persist.sys.mfz.enable 为 false 时写 0）
Upstream-Status: Not-Applicable
KABI: none
Depends-On: xiaomi/0028
Tested-On: clang 18.1.3 交叉编译 drivers/block/zram 通过；未实机验证

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c b/drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c
index fceb570e4..f3363aac8 100644
--- a/drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c
+++ b/drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c
@@ -2844,6 +2844,14 @@ static int zram_add(void)
 	init_rwsem(&zram->init_lock);
 #ifdef CONFIG_ZRAM_WRITEBACK
 	spin_lock_init(&zram->wb_limit_lock);
+#ifdef CONFIG_MI_MEMORY_FREEZE
+	/*
+	 * Xiaomi's default: on. PerfInit only ever writes 0 here (when
+	 * persist.sys.mfz.enable is false) and sets mfz_disk_quota itself.
+	 */
+	zram->mfz_enable = 1;
+	zram->mfz_disk_quota = 0;
+#endif
 	zram->writeback_pages = alloc_pages(GFP_KERNEL, MAX_WRITEBACK_ORDER);
 	if (zram->writeback_pages)
 		split_page(zram->writeback_pages, MAX_WRITEBACK_ORDER);
-- 
2.43.0

